Amit, Neha, and Sanjay welcome me.
Amit says, "Maya, you can play on my team."
I say, "Sure, I like to play doubles."
Neha and Sanjay are on the other team.
We start our match.
Sanjay serves the shuttle.
The shuttle comes very fast.
I hit the shuttle hard.
I can run fast on the court.
I play a lot of badminton in Mexico.
That is why my game is good.
Neha says with surprise, "Wow Maya, you play very well!"
I smile and thank her.
Amit and I play well together.
We can return every shot.
I like to play fast matches a lot.
After a while, we win the first game.
Sanjay claps and says, "You two are a strong team."
I enjoy playing with my new friends.
